# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets
# Never commit these. .env holds the Supabase password, JWT signing keys and
# the cookie secret — anything here on a public repo is compromised within
# minutes, because bots scrape GitHub for exactly this.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
supabase-ca.crt

